        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Medic",
        "text": "Ah!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Medic",
        "text": "This clinic..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Medic",
        "text": "Amiya, haven't we been here before?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_016_medic",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "You're right..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But why has it... become like this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_016_medic",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Medic",
        "text": "It's been totally abandoned... It looks it was attacked by Reunion."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_016_medic",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "name2": "char_013_riop",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "Wasn't this Azazel, the clinic for the Infected?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "name2": "char_013_riop",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Yes..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "name2": "char_013_riop",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "Even though they had access to Chernobog's entire underground intelligence network, they still refused to work with us..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "Back then, it wasn't clear what kind of dealings that had with Reunion..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "If only they had given us some information, or even just a hint..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "We could've been out of here by now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "They brought this outcome upon themselves!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "name2": "char_013_riop",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "That's not the entire story..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "name2": "char_013_riop",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "Amiya, you were there for the negotiations, weren't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "That cold and arrogant attitude of theirs really ticked me off..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "We can't blame them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_013_riop"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "Boss..."
    },
