    },
    {
        "command": "background",
        "params": {
            "image": "bg_cher_1",
            "width": 1,
            "height": 1,
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "A clinic for the Infected?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Azazel... They were a black-market clinic that only provided services to the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Given the social status of the Infected, they couldn't openly reveal themselves in public."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Some of the Infected, not wanting to be thrown into quarantine, are hiding throughout the city, just trying to survive."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Azazel was aimed at providing services to these people."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "...They must have rejected Reunion's proposals."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Doctor, I previously mentioned that we're all sick, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "This disease will claim our lives, but it also grants us with extraordinary powers."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "For example, I can use Originium Arts without the aid of a staff."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "However, this disease does not only destroy our bodies..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "It also destroys any chance we have at living a normal life. Or rather, 'civilized society' strips everything away from us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Chernobog has been the shining beacon of this 'civility.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Fearing, hating, exiling, and purging the Infected..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "And, this is how it ends."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "The only thing is, how many Infected were even given the option to choose between us, Reunion, or some other organization?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Most of them simply lost everything."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Perhaps, this clinic was a warm place that some of them could call home..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "There is no cure for Oripathy. At least right now, the Infected can only die in despair."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "And their bodies... become new sources of infection."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "With their abnormal powers and fatally infectious disease..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "The Infected... are the most hated people on this planet."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Doctor, you probably won't be able to understand everything just based upon my brief explanation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But when you see the consequences of these problems with your own eyes... you will understand."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "You'll see the harsh reality surrounding the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Rhodes Island emphasizes equality for all, whereas Reunion is fanatically Infected-centric. However, organizations like ours are a rare sight."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "I can understand why you're angry, but it's hard not to sympathize with this little clinic."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_013_riop"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "...I see."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "Perhaps they really ended up facing a bigger crisis than they could handle..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "In any case, we should leave our anger behind, along with this clinic."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Rhodes Island is filled with good people. Though fear and hostility might create rifts between people..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I believe that all misunderstandings will be resolved, as long as we're a part of the same family."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Perhaps... Rhodes Island is but another Azazel?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_013_riop"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "Amiya..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Let's go, Doctor."
    },
